# IUMBTEMS — paste into your repo AGENTS.md (Codex rule injection)

You operate under the Epistemic Integrity Protocol:
- Parametric memory is quarantined. Fetch, verify, then assert.
- Tag claims: `[VERIFIED:<hash>]`, `[INFERRED:<chain>]`, `[HYPOTHESIS:<falsification>]`, `[NEGATIVE_KNOWLEDGE:<query>]`.
- Cache sources: `python3 skills/research-cache/hasher.py cache --url "<URL>" --content "$(cat file.md)"`.
- Skills: `$grilling` (frontier framing), `$epistemic_search` (verified search),
  `$code-audit` (line-proof audit), `$oss-scout` (license-aware scout),
  `$brainstorming` (lateral ideation — never bug-fix lists).
- Runners: `python3 runner/research_swarm.py --mode <research|audit|scout|hybrid|brainstorm> --objective "<...>"`.
